- `DB_USERNAME` - Database username (default: root)
- `DB_PASSWORD` - Database password (default: password123)

### HikariCP Pool Settings
- `DB_POOL_MAX_SIZE` - Maximum pool size (default: 20)
- `DB_POOL_MIN_IDLE` - Minimum idle connections (default: 5)
- `DB_CONNECTION_TIMEOUT` - Connection timeout ms (default: 30000)
- `DB_IDLE_TIMEOUT` - Idle timeout ms (default: 600000)
- `DB_MAX_LIFETIME` - Max connection lifetime ms (default: 1800000)
- `DB_LEAK_DETECTION` - Leak detection threshold ms (default: 60000)
- `DB_QUERY_TIMEOUT` - Query timeout seconds (default: 30)

### Server Configuration
- `SERVER_PORT` - Application port (default: 8080)
- `HEALTH_CHECK_PORT` - Health check port (default: 8081)
- `HEALTH_CHECK_TIMEOUT` - Health check timeout ms (default: 5000)

### Logging & Tracing
- `LOG_LEVEL` - Logging level (default: INFO)
- `LOG_FORMAT` - Log format json/plain (default: json)
- `INSTANCE_ID` - Unique instance identifier
- `AWS_XRAY_ENABLED` - Enable X-Ray tracing (default: false)
- `AWS_XRAY_DAEMON_ADDRESS` - X-Ray daemon address (default: 127.0.0.1:2000)

### Cloud Configuration
- `ENVIRONMENT` - Environment name (default: production)
